<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Resource America started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Resource America started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Friedman, Billings, Ramsey &amp; Co Inc said it initiated coverage of Resource America Inc with an &quot;accumulate&quot; rating for risk-oriented investors.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Resource America lost 1-1/8 to 20-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
